### Test requests for Lift Log (needs `npm run server` running).
### With the REST Client extension in VS Code, click "Send Request" above each one.

### get every exercise
GET http://localhost:3001/todos HTTP/1.1

### create one with a weight -- the server gives it an id
POST http://localhost:3001/todos HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Deadlift",
  "weight": 185,
  "done": false
}

### create a bodyweight one -- weight is null, not 0
POST http://localhost:3001/todos HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Pull-ups",
  "weight": null,
  "done": false
}

### replace one (PUT replaces the WHOLE record -- leave weight out and it's gone)
PUT http://localhost:3001/todos/2 HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Bench press",
  "weight": 100,
  "done": false
}

### change one field, leave the rest alone
PATCH http://localhost:3001/todos/2 HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "done": true
}

### delete one
DELETE http://localhost:3001/todos/2 HTTP/1.1
